own throughout the school as the \"Palmtop Tiger.\"\n\nOne day, an embarrassing mistake causes the two students to cross paths. Ryuuji discovers that Taiga actually has a sweet side: she has a crush on the popular vice president, Yuusaku Kitamura, who happens to be his best friend. But things only get crazier when Ryuuji reveals that he has a crush on Minori Kushieda—Taiga's best friend!\n\nToradora! is a romantic comedy that follows this odd duo as they embark on a quest to help each other with their respective crushes, forming an unlikely alliance in the process."},"tags":[{"name":"Tsundere","rank":92,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slapstick","rank":68,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Food","rank":52,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Harem","rank":48,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":37,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Fake Relationship","rank":35,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Teacher","rank":32,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Toradora!","english":"Toradora!","native":"とらドラ！","romaji":"Toradora!","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"龙与虎"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"虎與龍"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"龍與虎"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"とらドラ"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"TIGER×DRAGON！"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"掌中萌虎"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"龙虎斗"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"虎与龙"}]},"trailer":{"id":"ya570uUgQNc","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ya570uUgQNc/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}